### 1. List all medicines (should be [] at first)
GET http://localhost:8084/api/medicines

### 2. Add a medicine
POST http://localhost:8084/api/medicines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Paracetamol 500 mg",
  "genericName": "Paracetamol",
  "form": "TABLET",
  "strength": "500 mg",
  "unit": "tablet",
  "reorderLevel": 100,
  "essential": false
}

### 3. Get medicine number 1
GET http://localhost:8084/api/medicines/1

### 4. Search by name
GET http://localhost:8084/api/medicines?search=para

### 5. How much of medicine 1 is at centre 1? (0 for now, no stock yet)
GET http://localhost:8084/api/medicines/1/availability?centreId=1

### 6. Medicine that doesn't exist -> expect 404
GET http://localhost:8084/api/medicines/999

### 7. Same name again -> expect 409
POST http://localhost:8084/api/medicines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Paracetamol 500 mg",
  "form": "TABLET",
  "reorderLevel": 100
}

### 8. Blank name and negative reorder level -> expect 400
POST http://localhost:8084/api/medicines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "form": "TABLET",
  "reorderLevel": -5
}
### 9. Batch A: expires SOON (100 tablets of Paracetamol at centre 1)
POST http://localhost:8084/api/medicines/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "centreId": 1,
  "batchNo": "B-101",
  "quantity": 100,
  "expiryDate": "2026-11-15"
}

### 10. Batch B: expires LATER (150 tablets, same medicine, same centre)
POST http://localhost:8084/api/medicines/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "centreId": 1,
  "batchNo": "B-205",
  "quantity": 150,
  "expiryDate": "2027-06-30"
}

### 11. Centre 1's stock -> should list both batches
GET http://localhost:8084/api/medicines/stock?centreId=1

### 12. Total now -> should say 250
GET http://localhost:8084/api/medicines/1/availability?centreId=1

### 13. Expiring within 60 days -> should list only B-101
GET http://localhost:8084/api/medicines/stock/expiring?days=60

### 14. Stock for a medicine that doesn't exist -> expect 404
POST http://localhost:8084/api/medicines/999/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "centreId": 1,
  "batchNo": "X-1",
  "quantity": 10,
  "expiryDate": "2027-01-01"
}